<title>HONG KONG: Interform sets US$20 million loan.</title>
<headline>Interform sets US$20 million loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceramics maker and distributor Interform Ceramics Technologies Ltd has launched a US$20 million term loan facility via its special purpose company, bankers said.</p>
<p>The facility has a maturity of three years and pays a margin of 175 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Long-Term Credit Bank of Japan and Bali International Finance are arrangers for the deal.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
